      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just so tired of it all. like, i feel like im constantly performing just to exist and it's getting harder to keep up the mask. i dont think i can ever actually be me in this world without everything falling apart. it feels like the cost of just being myself is just too high to keep paying.",
